      "title": "Install aws-cli from Alpine packages in release beta",
      "message": "Install aws-cli from Alpine packages in release beta\n\nThe alpine/helm image is based on Alpine 3.24, where pip enforces\nPEP 668 and a bare `pip install awscli` fails with\nexternally-managed-environment. Use the aws-cli package from the\nAlpine community repository instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <user@example.invalid>\nSigned-off-by: Maya Liskunov <user@example.invalid>\n",
